-- Row il-47, second part: the EXPECTED-RED tests of the long-term care regulations. This file goes with il47-references-044.l4 and can be removed with it.
-- Each defect fails two assertions, one per reading of the pair of descriptions of the same citation:
--   (1) the reference points at what the Law names today: the words say the committee (or section 232); the Law names the Institute (or no section).
--   (2) what the words name stands in the Law for a claim submitted on 10 November 2026: the answer on the pages read is JUST FALSE, and the assertion says JUST TRUE.
-- Five defects, ten failing assertions. The count is declared in check.sh and in encoding.json. A passing run of this file would mean the Law had been changed back or a reference replaced.
-- The sound control (regulation 3(א) to regulation 1) is asserted green in il47-references-044.l4.

